 {:id :interp-extends
  :title "a superclass the Java forms cannot extend yet: a class of the world not listed (ConcurrentHashMap, ConcurrentSkipListSet's kin in BiggernYours)"
  :kind :interp
  :why "interpreted classes extend Object, interpreted classes or arbace.j2g.model/class-supers' world classes (CLASSFORMS-REPL §2; since JC4b Thread, the collections, the streams, AssertionError, Calendar...: 47 more; since JC4c jrt's WeakReference, SoftReference, AtomicReference, InheritableThreadLocal with class interfaces, CopyOnWriteArraySet, CopyOnWriteArrayList, RecursiveAction, RecursiveTask); a class not listed gets no DynSub type"
  :decided "survey §6.1, JC4/JC6; JCS98 (a) built in JC4b, JCS111 (a) in JC4c (doc/classes/JAVA-CONFORMANCE-SURVEY.md, \"As built: JC4c\"); the rest JCS120"
  :proposal "JCS120"
  :match [#"cannot extend \S+ yet"]}
 {:id :interp-protected
  :title "a protected member of a world class that is not an extendable class's instance member (Object.finalize; a class outside arbace.j2g.model/class-supers and their superclasses: DeflaterOutputStream.def, AbstractQueuedLongSynchronizer, ClassLoader's, BreakIterator's and Calendar's own constructors, GregorianCalendar.computeTime of another object)"
  :kind :interp
  :why "interpreted code calls the world by reflection over jrt's public members (CLASSFORMS-REPL §7); since JC4b the extendable classes' and their superclasses' protected instance members are in the world's signatures (generics.edn's :protected) and reached through the DynSub types (Host.superCall, Host.superField)"
  :decided "survey §6.1, JC4; JCS98 (a) built in JC4b, JCS112 (a) in JC4c (the protected static methods in the member tables), the rest by design or JCS120's (doc/classes/JAVA-CONFORMANCE-SURVEY.md, \"As built: JC4c\")"
  :proposal "JCS120"
  :match [#"No accessible (static )?method \w+ in (t\d{5}|compiler)\." #"No field \w+ in (t\d{5}|compiler)\."
          #"^load-failed No accessible constructor of java\." #"^load-failed No matching constructor of java/(util|lang)/\w+ for argument types \[\]" #"computeTime in java\.util\.GregorianCalendar"]}
 {:id :repl-sibling
