          #"ClassNotFoundException: (?!java|javax|sun|jdk|com\.sun)[a-z]\w*\."]}
 {:id :j2g-unresolved
  :title "j2g: a class whose analysis stops at a type the world does not have (Cannot convert ... of type :null to, an empty message): the world, not the analysis"
  :kind :world
  :level :compiled
  :why "j2g analyzes every member of a test's classes; a field or method naming a JDK class outside the forms, jrt and the edge resolves to nothing, and the conversion that needs its type fails with an empty target (or a member of a class built on it is not found: OpsAfterClose's enum constant bodies over RandomAccessFile, ReferenceClone's PhantomReference subclass, HeadersTest's HTTP client); the interp level fails the same tests on the class itself, at run time (doc/classes/JAVA-CONFORMANCE-SURVEY.md, \"As built: JC5\")"
  :decided "JCS69 (a), then (b): the world, until JCS44 (a)'s messages name the class, then the analysis failing at the unresolved class itself (doc/classes/JAVA-CONFORMANCE-SURVEY.md, \"Decided (2026-10-25): JCS60-JCS69\")"
  :proposal "JCS69"
  :tests ["t04357" "t04823" "t05071"]
  :match [#"^refused j2g: \S+: analysis: Cannot convert .* of type \S+ to\s*(\(line|/|$)" #"^refused j2g: \S+: analysis: ?(\(line|/|$)"
          #"^refused j2g: \S+: analysis: (No accessible constructor of (t\d{5}|compiler)\.|No static field \w+ in (t\d{5}|compiler)/|Bad set! target|No matching constructor of enum constant)"]}
 {:id :j2g-go
  :title "j2g: Go that does not compile (a local class's captured values missing from its constructor call, a captured variable undefined in a lambda or a nested local class, an any returned as int32, finalize of a class that does not declare it, a member through a null constant)"
  :kind :j2g
